      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I tried this model out.  Even with NNLC enabled, it's jerky, and it seems to overcorrect with steering quickly.  It did stop at a stop sign and didn't proceed, which was a first for me.  But the lateral on this one is just not good.  I went back to NDv2.",
